  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maritime Days Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In the upcoming years, the Government of Bangladesh wants to increase investments in the maritime sector and develop the Blue Economy in Bangladesh. This creates trade and investment opportunities for the Dutch Delta Technology and Maritime sector.In October 2023, Bangladesh will organize the 5th Edition of Bangladesh International Marine and Offshore Expo 2023 (BIMOX). To make use of this opportunity, the Netherlands Embassy in Dhaka and RVO will organize the first Netherlands Maritime Days in Bangladesh as part and site event of the international Expo. The goals of this project is to; &#x2022;	strengthen the relationship between Bangladesh and The Netherlands and enhance privatesector and economic cooperation in the field of maritime and delta technology;&#x2022;	explore potential opportunities for private and public-private investment opportunities and collaboration between the Dutch and Bangladeshi Maritime and delta technology sectors; &#x2022;	showcase the Dutch expertise and technology and in particularly the interest of the Dutch Maritime, Delta technology and knowledge industry for the Bangladeshi market; and&#x2022;	collect further input for the formulation and implementation of a Dutch Vision and Strategy for the Water Sector in Bangladesh beyond ODA.</narrative>
  </description>
